## Modifications

### Version 3.0.0

Published under its own add-on slug (`ha_whatsapp`).

- Pinned Baileys to 7.0.0-rc14 with a committed lockfile; removed the vendored
  copy of Baileys 6.7.12.
- Added an ingress panel for pairing by QR code or 8-digit pairing code.
- Added an authenticated, schema-validated `/api/v1`, keeping the original
  endpoints working unchanged for backwards compatibility.
- Replaced the container-IP rewriting of the custom component with a stable
  hostname published by the add-on at startup.
- Reworked reconnection, error handling, logging and connection state
  reporting; added a test suite and working CI.

### Version 2.0.0 (December 31, 2025)

- Updated Baileys from 6.7.12 to 7.0.0-rc.9.
- Migrated from CommonJS to ES Modules.
- Added a health check endpoint.

